  "content": "<p>Mermod 添加了一條神奇的項鍊，讓你在水中變成人魚！更多資訊，請參考<a href=\"https://github.com/ThatPreston/Mermod-Fabric/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方維基。</a></p><p>從 3.0.0 版本開始，此模組需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API。</a></p><p>如需此模組的 Fabric 版本，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mermod-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">請點擊這裡。</a></p><p>官方 Discord 伺服器：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/QS9Daqs4WX\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/QS9Daqs4WX</a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/8fbbf2cef1eec3f1ae867b615963e510.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"704\" height=\"87\"></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/52404366/171579611-f2a2b24b-8d08-46e4-8bc6-f388545266ae.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"258\"></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/52404366/171579631-12870cc2-0dcc-4c83-9c7e-4a0745e50db4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"258\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/367c0814ff468713195e1d60bd7aaaba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"704\" height=\"176\"></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/52404366/177890474-3397e1d9-533a-4dfe-a345-ffe381b4d84b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"258\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/6b713760595919050fe09b66b3bc8fd9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"704\" height=\"592\"></p>",
